{{also|strike out}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From the verb phrase {{m|en|strike out}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An instance or the act of yielding nothing
#: ''We've had one '''strikeout''' after the other on the Jones account.''
# {{lb|en|baseball}} An instance or the act of striking out
#: ''The pitcher recorded seven '''strikeouts''' in the game.''
# {{lb|en|computing|wordprocessing}} Cancellation of a portion of text by [[cross out|crossing it out]] without deleting it; [[strikethrough]].

====Translations====
